t=\"37\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/37\" title=\"37\">37</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>1.7</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>银行</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>咏叹的瞬间</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：306603</div></div></div></div><div class=\"skin-video tabber\"><h2><span id=\".E8.A7.86.E9.A2.91.E9.A2.84.E8.A7.88\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"视频预览\">视频预览</span></h2><div class=\"tabber-filter\" style=\"margin:0 -3px 4px -3px\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button selected\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"5\">技能1</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"4\">技能2</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"3\">大招</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"2\">追击</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"1\">入场</div></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"5\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3066/306603/技能一.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3066/306603/技能一 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"4\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3066/306603/技能二.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3066/306603/技能二 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"3\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3066/306603/大招.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3066/306603/大招 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"2\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3066/306603/37追击.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3066/306603/37追击 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"1\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3066/306603/入场.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3066/306603/入场 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">灯光渐渐地暗了下去，森林从黑暗中浮现出来。<br />身着绿衣的捕鸟人正坐在树上，她将排箫举到嘴边，吹奏出第一个音符。这些音符像一串发光的素数，向远方飞去。随后，隐约的啁啾声从遥远的草叶深处，传至她的耳畔。<br />也许是害怕惊扰了远方的鸟儿，观众席中有人屏住了呼吸。<br />鸟儿们不负众望地出来了——那些彩色的、炫目的、闪着光的精灵。它们身披霞光的精粹，扑着翅膀落在了舞台的中心。其中一只踉跄地摔下，恰巧落在了捕鸟人的掌心。<br />在二楼的包厢里，有人举起了相机，将这一幕定格为永恒。</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"306603\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-306604.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/0/02/Belonging-306604.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“斐波那契数列”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"Fibonacci Sequence\"</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />55<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>由布、纱和丝绸等材料做成的花冠，精巧的做工让它们看起来像仍沾着晨间的露珠。上面的每种花都正好是花瓣数量符合斐波那契数列的品种，因此颇受佩戴者的青睐。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-306605.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/1/12/Belonging-306605.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“点与线”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"Dots and Lines\"</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />120<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>佩戴者多次强调它是一桩“很好的证明”。但实际上，它仍然只是一条由塑料珍珠穿成的普通发饰。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-306606.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/c/c3/Belonging-306606.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“分形几何”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"Fractal Geometry\"</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />20<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一根由不明鸟类自然脱落的羽毛。佩戴者醉心于这美丽图形的规律，将它装饰在了小腿的黄金分割点处。</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%BF%AB%E4%B9%90%E7%9A%84%E6%8D%95%E9%B8%9F%E4%BA%BA1.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 快乐的捕鸟人1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%BF%AB%E4%B9%90%E7%9A%84%E6%8D%95%E9%B8%9F%E4%BA%BA1.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%BF%AB%E4%B9%90%E7%9A%84%E6%8D%95%E9%B8%9F%E4%BA%BA1.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%BF%AB%E4%B9%90%E7%9A%84%E6%8D%95%E9%B8%9F%E4%BA%BA1.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%BF%AB%E4%B9%90%E7%9A%84%E6%8D%95%E9%B8%9F%E4%BA%BA1.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%BF%AB%E4%B9%90%E7%9A%84%E6%8D%95%E9%B8%9F%E4%BA%BA1.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%BF%AB%E4%B9%90%E7%9A%84%E6%8D%95%E9%B8%9F%E4%BA%BA1.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%